ke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"{{ x.mkW }}\"></path></svg></sc-if></button></span></sc-if>\n</div></sc-for>\n</div></sc-if>\n\n\n<sc-if value=\"{{ hasMore }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;padding:12px 0 6px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3B5255\">{{ showingLbl }}</span><button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ showMore }}\" style=\"height:40px;padding:0 18px;border:1px solid #BAAEC6;border-radius:0;background:#FFFFFF;color:var(--sj-purple-900);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;cursor:pointer\" style-hover=\"background:#F3EEF7\">SHOW {{ pageN }} MORE</button><button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ showAll }}\" style=\"border:0;background:none;padding:0;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--sj-purple-900);text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer\">Show all</button></div></sc-if>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"source\" data-screen-label=\"Sourcing request\" style=\"padding:20px clamp(14px,4vw,28px) 8px;scroll-margin-top:140px\">\n<div style=\"background:var(--sj-teal-900);color:#FFFFFF;padding:18px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px 20px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;flex:1 1 320px\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:var(--sj-teal-200)\">CAN'T FIND IT?</span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;font-weight:800\">WE'LL SOURCE THE DIAMOND FOR YOU</span><span style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:var(--sj-cream)\">Tell us the shape, size, color, clarity and budget you need. We search beyond this list and come back to you with options.</span></div><button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ tgSrc }}\" style=\"height:44px;padding:0 18px;border:0;border-radius:0;background:#FFFFFF;color:var(--sj-teal-900);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap\" style-hover=\"background:var(--sj-teal-200)\">{{ srcBtn }}</button></div>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ srcOpen }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #BAAEC6;border-top:0;padding:20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(220px,100%),1fr));gap:14px\">\n<label style=\"grid-column:1 / -1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.8px;color:#3B5255\">WHAT YOU'RE LOOKING FOR <span style=\"color:var(--sj-purple-900)\">*</span></span><textarea value=\"{{ srcDesc }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ setSrcDesc }}\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"e.g. 2.00\u20132.20 ct oval, E\u2013F, VS1 or better, ratio 1.40\u20131.50, matching pair\" style=\"padding:12px;border:{{ srcDescBd }};border-radius:0;color:var(--sj-teal-900);font-size:15px;line-height:22px;resize:vertical\"></textarea><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:#3B5255\">We filled this in from your current filters. Edit it freely.</span><sc-if value=\"{{ srcDescErr }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--sj-error)\">Describe the diamond you need.</span></sc-if></label>\n<label style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.8px;color:#3B5255\">QUANTITY</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" value=\"{{ srcQty }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ setSrcQty }}\" style=\"height:46px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid #C3CFCC;border-radius:0;color:var(--sj-teal-900);font-size:15px\"></label>\n<label style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.8px;color:#3B5255\">TARGET PRICE PER STONE</span><input type=\"text\" value=\"{{ srcBudget }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ setSrcBudget }}\" placeholder=\"$\" style=\"height:46px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid #C3CFCC;border-radius:0;color:var(--sj-teal-900);font-size:15px\"></label>\n<label style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.8px;color:#3B5255\">NEEDED BY</span><input type=\"date\" value=\"{{ srcDate }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ setSrcDate }}\" style=\"height:46px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid #C3CFCC;border-radius:0;color:var(--sj-teal-900);font-size:15px\"></label>\n<label style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.8px;color:#3B5255\">COMPANY NAME <span style=\"color:var(--sj-purple-900)\">*</span></span><input type=\"text\" value=\"{{ company }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ setCompany }}\" placeholder=\"Your store or business name\" style=\"height:46px;padding:0 12px;border:{{ sCompanyBd }};border-radius:0;color:var(--sj-teal-900);font-size:15px\"><sc-if value=\"{{ sCompanyErr }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--sj-error)\">Company name is required.</span></sc-if></label>\n<label style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.8px;color:#3B5255\">CONTACT NAME <span style=\"color:var(--sj-purple-900)\">*</span></span><input type=\"text\" value=\"{{ contact }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ setContact }}\" placeholder=\"First and last name\" style=\"height:46px;padding:0 12px;border:{{ sContactBd }};border-radius:0;color:var(--sj-teal-900);font-size:15px\"><sc-if value=\"{{ sContactErr }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--sj-error)\">Contact name is required.</span></sc-if></label>\n<label style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.8px;color:#3B5255\">CONTACT PHONE <span style=\"color:var(--sj-purple-900)\">*</span></span><input type=\"tel\" value=\"{{ phone }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ setPhone }}\" placeholder=\"(555) 555-5555\" style=\"height:46px;padding:0 12px;border:{{ sPhoneBd }};border-radius:0;color:var(--sj-teal-900);font-size:15px\"><sc-if value=\"{{ sPhoneErr }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--sj-error)\">Enter at least 10 digits.</span></sc-if></label>\n<label style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.8px;color:#3B5255\">YOUR EMAIL <span style=\"color:var(--sj-purple-900)\">*</span></span><input type=\"email\" value=\"{{ email }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ setEmail }}\" placeholder=\"you@yourstore.com\" style=\"height:46px;padding:0 12px;border:{{ sEmailBd }};border-radius:0;color:var(--sj-teal-900);font-size:15px\"><sc-if value=\"{{ sEmailErr }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--sj-error)\">Enter a valid email.</span></sc-if></label>\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ submitSrc }}\" style=\"grid-column:1 / -1;height:52px;border:0;border-radius:0;background:#3A2049;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;cursor:pointer\" style-hover=\"background:var(--sj-purple-900)\">{{ srcSubmitLbl }}</button>\n</div></sc-if>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ srcDone }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\"><div role=\"status\" style=\"border:1px solid #BAAEC6;border-top:0;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;background:#F3EEF7\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:var(--sj-purple-900)\">SOURCING REQUEST SENT</span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;color:#3A2049\">#{{ srcRef }}</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#3A2049;max-width:680px\">Looking for: {{ srcSentDesc }}. Our team will search for this and contact you with options. Keep this number to check on it.</span><sc-if value=\"{{ srcFailed }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--sj-error)\">We couldn't confirm it was sent. Please call +1 (888) 623-1817.</spa